PRO-FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION OF PROJECT CARGO HEAVY HAUL INC.

WHEREAS the Articles of Incorporation were filed with the Ontario Ministry of Public and Business Service Delivery;

RESOLVED that the Articles of Incorporation be approved and adopted in full;

RESOLVED that the registered office of the Corporation be established at 123 Main Street, Suite 100, Toronto, Ontario, Canada M5V 2T4;

RESOLVED that [Director 1 Name] be appointed as the first Director, President, and Chief Executive Officer, and [Director 2 Name] as the first Secretary and Treasurer;

RESOLVED that the Corporation issue and allot [Number] common shares at a par value of $1.00 per share, with full payment upon subscription;

RESOLVED that the Corporation open a corporate bank account and adopt standard banking resolutions;

RESOLVED that all actions of the incorporator in preparing the Articles be ratified.

This resolution is passed on [Date] and effective immediately.
